sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as 브라우저 Settings
  participant SC as SettingsController (/api/setting)
  participant DB as settings 테이블
  participant CH as AssetItemUpdateChannel
  participant SM as StateManager.ExecuteAsync
  participant E as EventDataStore (메모리)
  participant D as 도크
  B->>SC: POST /api/setting/json<br/>(dock.sorting.param, B22)
  SC->>DB: 저장 (Version, RowVersion)
  SC->>CH: 변경 통지
  CH->>SM: DispatchSettingChannelMessageAsync
  SM->>E: UpdateAsync(DockSortingActiveParameter, B22)
  D->>SM: 다음 heartbeat
  SM-->>D: SetParameter = 새 설정
  Note over SC,E: DELETE 는 채널 통지 없음<br/>→ 메모리에 이전 값 잔존
